# Rust / Tauri build artifacts
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Local development scratch & internal notes (not contributor-facing)
# RE scratch: raw radio binary dumps, golden fixtures, findings notes
scratchpad/
# local Claude Code settings — reference real machine paths/username.
# Only the settings files are local; .claude/skills/ is committed on purpose,
# because a process that lives on one machine is a process nobody else follows.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.json
# internal cross-session dev journal, stays local
PROJECT_STATE.md

# Database backups. The app's "Backup database" writes a full copy of the
# master database — every channel, call sign and location the operator has —
# and the save dialog will happily land one inside the repo. Never committed.
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3.before-restore
